{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"Let's simplify $\\blueD{2^1+3^1}$.\n\n\n$\\begin{align} \u0026\\phantom{=}\\blueD{2^1+3^1}\n \\\\\n\u0026={2+3} \\\\\n\u0026 = \\blueD5 \\end{align}$\n","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Now let's simplify $\\greenD{{2^3}-{2^1}}$.\n\n$\\begin{align} \u0026\\phantom{=}\\greenD{2^3-2^1}\n \\\\\n\u0026={8-2} \\\\\n\u0026 = \\greenD6 \\end{align}$\n\n","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"And finally, $\\purpleD{3^2}=3\\cdot3 = \\purpleD9$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Now we can order the expressions.\n\n$\\blueD5\u003c\\greenD6\u003c\\purpleD9$ \n\nSo, $\\blueD{2^1+3^1}\u003c\\greenD{2^3-2^1}\u003c\\purpleD{3^2}$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"The expressions from least to greatest are:  \n\n $2^1+3^1$  \n $2^3-2^1$  \n $3^2$\n","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Order the expressions from least to greatest.**\n\n\n[[☃ sorter 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"sorter 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"correct":["$2^1+3^1$","$2^3-2^1$","$3^2$"],"layout":"horizontal","padding":true},"static":false,"type":"sorter","version":{"major":0,"minor":0}}}}}
